Long Beach AIS + ENC port-operations benchmark:
Historical AIS source inventory is from NOAA Office for Coastal Management,
BOEM, and the U.S. Coast Guard AccessAIS/Vessel Traffic Data services. Derived
chart geometry is from NOAA ENC Direct to GIS. The bundled 2025 hourly weather
and marine forcing is attributed to Open-Meteo under CC BY 4.0. Exact URLs,
retrieval timestamps, source hashes, and research-only boundaries are recorded
under data/public and docs/DATA_SOURCES.md.

